"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-13T21:32:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T09:45:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-10900KF CPU @ 3.70GHz (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn project settings option to \"Run on separate thread\" is enabled. but node runs _physic_process on main thread.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nadd simple script\n\n```\nvar dt :=0.0\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tdt+=delta\n\tif(dt>1.0):\n\t\tdt =0.0\n\t\tprint(\"_process thread:\",OS.get_thread_caller_id())\n\nvar pdt :=0.0\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tpdt += delta\n\tif(pdt>1.0):\n\t\tpdt =0.0\n\t\tprint(\"_physics_process  thread:\",OS.get_thread_caller_id())\n```\n\ncheck the output.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n[godot4-4-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19237070/godot4-4-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104085/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}